	ida_struct.set_member_cmt(ida_struct.get_member(struc, 76320), '''String: "Satoshi, often abbreviated as \'sat\', is a smaller denomination of Bitcoin. It\'s used primarily for display and calculation purposes. When we talk about rewards or transactions, we might use the term \'Satoshi\' to represent a fractional amount of Bitcoin. However, in our app the underlying currency of your rewards and withdrawals is always Bitcoin."''', True)
